    "noteZh": "README 目录是 Getting started / How to define and document components / Examples / Visual helpers / Debugging / ToDo，起步命令为 npx badoo-styleguide --dev，并要求在项目里建一个 styleguide.config.js。About 栏的原话是 Badoo styleguide used to develop UI components for the Web and React Native，话题标签打了 react、react-native、sass、styleguide。页面顶部显示 40 Branches、93 Tags、516 Commits，最新一条提交是 update to 2.1.3。",
